be88a2fe (55 1793244672885 "guenchi" (("1lwdlzul" . 1) ("o01rj2kt" . 9352)) (put ((kind . section) (title . "landing g2g3") (src . "gfx: rasterizer state in the command stream; shader forms take qualifiers, const and loop exits\n\n(gfx gl) gains four state commands, opcodes 47 to 50: cmd-depth-func!,\ncmd-polygon-offset!, cmd-color-mask! and cmd-cull-face!.  As commands they\ntake effect where they sit in the stream, between the draws they govern,\ninstead of where a direct GL call happened.  Every argument is checked\nbefore the first word is written, so a refused name or number leaves the\nstream as it was; the polygon offset is refused outside f32 range, since\nthe stream carries f32.\n\nThe shader forms of (gfx glsl) gain (Q T name) parameters with Q one of\nin, out and inout, a top-level (const T name expr) in both GLSL dialects,\nand the statements (break) and (continue).  glsl-check refuses a loop exit\noutside a for of the same function, a loop exit with operands, another\nqualifier, and a reserved name in a qualified parameter or a constant.\n(gfx wgsl) carries break, continue and in parameters; a constant and an out\nor inout parameter are refused by wgsl-check instead of being dropped from\nthe module.\n") (parent . root) (ord . 745))))
